<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40870" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπισκῐ-άζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>throw a shade upon, overshadow</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ [πτέρυγι] τὴν Ἀσίην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.209
				</span></i>
			. cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>GA</u>
				780a30
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				2.18.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Matt.</u>
				17.5
			</span></i>: c.dat., <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Sens.</u>
				79
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Marc.</u>
				9.7
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.262
			</span></i>, al.; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φωτίζειν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>P.</u>
				1.141
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-σκιάζεσθαι τὸν ἥλιον</span>
			<i>to ward off</i> the sun's rays, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Gp.</u>
				5.29.3
			</span></i>: metaph., <i>conceal, obscure</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλήθειαν πλάσμασι</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μυθικοῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.41
				</span></i>
			, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ δεινὰ ἑτέροις ὀνόμασιν
				ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Junc.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				4.50.95
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν θωπείαν, τὸν βίον</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Hist.Conscr.</u>
				11
			</span></i>, v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Cal.</u>
				1
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ εὐγενεία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdn.
					2.10.3
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαθραῖον ὄμμ᾽ ἐπεσκιασμένη</span>
			<i>keeping a hidden</i> watch, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				914
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>. <i>darken,
				obscure</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.223
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			): metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφροσύνη ἐ. ψυχήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					1.685
				</span></i>
			, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>. of the
			Divine presence, <i>overshadow</i> for protection, etc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Ps.</u>
					90(91).4
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ τὴν κεφαλήν</span>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινος</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				139(140).8
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δύναμις ὑψίστου ἐπισκιάσει σοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ev.Luc.</u>
					1.35
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>. 
				Pass.
			, <i>to be weak-sighted</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Vett.Val.
				111.1
			</span></i>.</div>
